description = "Hydrogen is the first Atomon ever discovered and is considered the building block of many stronger species. 

It prefers to travel in groups and rarely stays still for long. 

Although harmless on its own, skilled trainers know that Hydrogen's true strength lies in the powerful combinations it can create with other Atomons."
